            {
              "id": "./examples/tempietto/Tempietto.glb/scene/annotation/tour-06-roof",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": [
                "commenting"
              ],
              "label": {
                "en": [
                  "Pediment and roof - a hypothesis"
                ],
                "pl": [
                  "Fronton i dach - hipoteza"
                ],
                "de": [
                  "Giebel und Dach - eine Hypothese"
                ]
              },
              "created": "2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z",
              "modified": "2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z",
              "body": {
                "type": "Choice",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "type": "TextualBody",
                    "value": "Nothing of the roof has survived. The gabled roof with its pediments follows the proportions of comparable temples and is a hypothesis; the Level of Certainty view marks it as such.",
                    "format": "text/plain",
                    "language": [
                      "en"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "TextualBody",
                    "value": "Z dachu nic się nie zachowało. Dwuspadowy dach z frontonami odtworzono według proporcji porównywalnych świątyń i jest hipotezą; widok poziomu pewności tak go oznacza.",
                    "format": "text/plain",
                    "language": [
                      "pl"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "TextualBody",
                    "value": "Vom Dach ist nichts erhalten. Das Satteldach mit seinen Giebeln folgt den Proportionen vergleichbarer Tempel und ist eine Hypothese; die Ansicht des Gewissheitsgrades kennzeichnet es so.",
                    "format": "text/plain",
                    "language": [
                      "de"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "target": {
                "type": "SpecificResource",
                "source": {
                  "id": "./examples/tempietto/Tempietto.glb/scene",
                  "type": "Scene"
                },
                "selector": [
                  {
                    "type": "PointSelector",
                    "x": 0,
